Prior work referenced by the opt-in Instagram pull
--------------------------------------------------

save-insta-posts
  https://github.com/flynnsharwood/save-insta-posts
  Author: flynnsharwood
  License: none stated

  backend/gramvault/ingestion/instagram.py is an independent
  implementation written for this project. It was informed by the
  approach save-insta-posts established for downloading one's own saved
  Instagram posts with Instaloader: a cookies-only login, a newest-first
  walk that stops once it catches up, jittered delays between requests,
  and materialising the download in the shape of an official data export.
  No code from save-insta-posts is vendored or copied here.

Instaloader
  https://instaloader.github.io/
  License: MIT
  Optional dependency (`pip install -e ".[instagram]"`); performs the
  actual downloading for the opt-in pull feature.


